Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 10:27:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] gui, snapshot: fix the CI lint findings and tidy
 snapshot/go.mod

golangci-lint (staticcheck "all", as configured in gui/.golangci.yml)
failed on upstream code, which blocks the build job:
- ST1005: capitalized error string in startMachineBackupDirect.
- QF1001 (x3): negated compound credential checks in the restore paths;
  name the condition (hasCreds) instead.

snapshot/go.mod listed go-vss as indirect although win_snapshot.go
imports it directly (`go mod tidy -diff` was not clean).
---
 gui/main.go           | 2 +-
 gui/restore_inline.go | 6 ++++--
 gui/restore_search.go | 3 ++-
 snapshot/go.mod       | 3 ++-
 4 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gui/main.go b/gui/main.go
index 79b4600..da5ad91 100644
--- a/gui/main.go
+++ b/gui/main.go
@@ -1056,7 +1056,7 @@ func (a *App) startMachineBackupDirect(backupType string, backupDevices []string
 	// Validate backup devices
 	for _, device := range backupDevices {
 		if device == "" {
-			return fmt.Errorf("One or more devices are empty")
+			return fmt.Errorf("one or more devices are empty")
 		}
 	}
 
